        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Opéra-Comique, Paris\n- People: Daniel Auber, leading tenor\n- Works: the work, the opera, Les Rendezvous\n- Events: premiere, first performance\n\nFacts:\n- The work was first performed at the Opéra-Comique in Paris in 1846 with a leading tenor.\n- Daniel Auber had previously contributed music to the one-act ballet Les Rendezvous in September 1933.\n- The leading tenor sang in the premiere of an opera featuring music by Daniel Auber.",
